Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在宇宙最寒冷的地区 凶残的奥格都·杰哈德 混乱七神 沉睡在他们的水晶禁地之中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.59,0:00:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待着重新掌控大地 焚毁天堂 德斯·维尔密斯传说 第87页
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.59,0:01:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么使一个男人成为真正的男人呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it that makes a man a man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他的出身 他的本源？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it his origins, the way things start?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.29,0:01:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是其它一些难以说清的东西呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is it something else, something harder to describe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.80,0:01:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,而对我来说 这一切始于1944年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me, it all began in 1944.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.50,0:01:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在苏格兰海岸执行的一次秘密任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Classified mission off the coast of Scotland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳粹们已经走投无路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Nazis were desperate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们试图利用黑魔法和科学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Combining science and black magic…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.11,0:01:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,打破战争的平衡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they intended to upset the balance of the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.92,0:01:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我28岁时就已成为罗斯福总统的灵异现象顾问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was 28, already a paranormal advisor to President Roosevelt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.42,0:01:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我从未想到那晚发生的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could never have suspected that what would transpire that night…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.06,0:01:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅改变了历史的进程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…would not only affect the course of history…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.30,0:01:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还永远改变了我的一生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but change my life forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 小伙子们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, men, let's go. Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.69,0:01:48.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（苏格兰 1944年10月9日）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.64,0:01:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上 上啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.94,0:01:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,分散开来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's fan it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.32,0:02:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your men…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.85,0:02:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they'll need these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是天主教徒吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a Catholic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.19,0:02:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 还有其他原因 不过这很难说清{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Among other things. But that's hardly the point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.79,0:02:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你需要这个东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're gonna need one of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.53,0:02:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我痛恨使用暴力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l abhor the use of violence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.80,0:02:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 我希望你别把我当疯子 魏特曼士官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. I wouldn't want you to think me mad, Sergeant Whitman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.24,0:02:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经三天了 现在想这个太晚了 布隆姆教授{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, three days too late for that, Professor Broom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.97,0:02:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,小伙子们 出发吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you guys, let's move, move, move, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.95,0:02:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,小伙子们 上 上啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on boys, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.05,0:02:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走！左面 右面！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way! Left, right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.75,0:02:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,上啊 快啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, men, let's get the lead out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要到了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're close!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.05,0:02:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在浪费我们的时间 这岛上除了绵羊和岩石什么都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wasting our time. There's nothing here but sheep and rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.56,0:02:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是遗迹 不是岩石 - 就在那里停下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ruins, not rocks. - Hold it right here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.66,0:02:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是特隆德汉姆·阿比的遗迹 建在草地边界的交叉点上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The remains of Trondham Abbey, built on an intersection of ley lines…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.30,0:02:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是人类世界和其他世界的边界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the boundaries between our world and the others…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.57,0:02:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,废话连篇！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a load of crap!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.73,0:02:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 一周前 我还没听说过「反常现象」这个词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, a week ago, I never even heard the word "parabnormal."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.07,0:02:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是灵异现象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paranormal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.54,0:02:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.58,0:03:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持阵型！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold the line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.61,0:03:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来此一定是为了绵羊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must be here for the sheep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.84,0:03:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个带防毒面具的怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The freak in the gas mask…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.51,0:03:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔·卢布里切特·克鲁南{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karl Ruprecht Kroenen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.75,0:03:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,希特勒的头号杀手 北方神秘协会的头目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hitler's top assassin and head of the Thule Occult Society.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他在这里 那比我想像的还要糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lf he's here, this is worse than I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.78,0:04:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论今晚发生了什么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what happens tonight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.19,0:04:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,…这本书都会把你带回我身边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this book will guide you back to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会离开你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l will not leave you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.19,0:04:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将赐予你不朽的生命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l grant you everlasting life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不褪的青春{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…youth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.90,0:04:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及辅佐我的魔力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the power to serve me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.47,0:04:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊萨！格里高利！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}llsa! Grigori!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.04,0:04:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.15,0:04:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年的研究和建筑啊 格里高利！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five years of research and construction, Grigori.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five years!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.72,0:04:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,元首不会容忍失败的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fuhrer doesn't look kindly on failure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.23,0:04:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 不会失败的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be no failure, general.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.30,0:05:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向元首保证将有一个奇迹出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l promised Herr Hitler a miracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.93,0:05:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带来一个奇迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'll deliver one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.81,0:05:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今晚所作的一切将永世流传！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I will do tonight can never be undone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.05,0:05:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今晚所作的一切将永世流传！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I will do tonight can never be undone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.18,0:05:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会打开地狱之门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l will open a portal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.79,0:05:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,唤醒奥格都·杰哈德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and awaken the Ogdru Jahad:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.49,0:05:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,混乱七神！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Seven Gods of Chaos!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.69,0:05:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的敌人将被毁灭！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our enemies will be destroyed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.63,0:05:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,废墟中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And from the ashes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个新的伊甸园将诞生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a new Eden will arise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.02,0:07:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧倒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想拍张照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l was taking a picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.26,0:07:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,再拍我就砸掉你的像机！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do that again and l'll carve you a new one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.06,0:07:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 传送门已经打开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, the portal is open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须阻止他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand? We have to stop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,手雷！手雷！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}grenade! grenade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊！冲啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.98,0:08:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.19,0:08:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.70,0:09:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多结束了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.41,0:09:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 还没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.28,0:09:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,传送门打开的时间太长了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The portal's been open for too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有东西已经从那边过来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something may have come through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你手下彻底搜索整个区域{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have your men search the area thoroughly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.92,0:09:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜查那边！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spread out over that way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:10:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 这上面有东西！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir! Something up here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.63,0:10:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.64,0:10:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说有些东西会过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you said something came through…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.07,0:10:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,从哪里来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.75,0:10:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也没有看到！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't see them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.79,0:10:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的相信地狱存在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really, really believe in hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.63,0:10:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一个黑暗的世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a place, a dark place…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.63,0:10:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,远古的魔鬼在那里沉睡 等待着回归{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where ancient evil slumbers and waits to return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格里高利今晚让我们一窥地狱 - 格里高利？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grigori gave us a glance tonight. - Grigori?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.34,0:10:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是俄国名字 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Russian, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.94,0:10:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里高利·艾菲莫维奇·拉斯普亭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grigori Efimovich Rasputin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.44,0:10:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉斯普亭？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rasputin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.71,0:10:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快说啊 - 俄国沙皇的神秘学顾问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Occult adviser to the Romanovs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.31,0:10:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在1916年的一次晚宴上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln 1916, at a dinner in his honor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.28,0:11:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,被下毒 枪击 刀刺 棒打…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he was poisoned, shot, stabbed, clubbed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.39,0:11:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,…阉割 最后沉湖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…castrated and finally drowned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.56,0:11:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们今晚却看见了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, we saw him here tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.16,0:11:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,布隆姆教授{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Broom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.30,0:11:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful. Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.49,0:11:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是个什么鬼东西？猿猴吗？- 不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell is that? An ape? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是红色的 亮红色的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt was red. Bright red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.47,0:11:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把灯放低点 你吓到他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower your light, you're scaring it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.50,0:11:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们两个在射击什么？- 一只红色猿猴！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you two shooting at? - A red ape!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.44,0:11:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是猿猴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not an ape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他手里有个大石头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got a big stone in its hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.14,0:11:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想那就是他的手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l think that is its hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.21,0:12:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那锤子怎么那么大啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the size of that whammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.58,0:12:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等一下 等等！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait! Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我件毯子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A blanket. Get me a blanket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.43,0:12:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 来啊 这很安全的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on. It's safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.93,0:12:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.13,0:12:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 跳下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Jump down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.07,0:12:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个男孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.94,0:13:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个小婴孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a baby boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.98,0:13:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,往左一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move to the left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.25,0:13:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 我成为了一个怪胎的父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we were, an unready father for an unwanted child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.39,0:13:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在当晚就给他取了个名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boys gave him a name that very night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,回想起来 这名字并不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In retrospect, perhaps not the most fortunate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.80,0:13:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我们也叫习惯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nevertheless, a name we all came to use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.77,0:13:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们叫他「地狱男爵」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We called him Hellboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.27,0:13:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看镜头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the birdie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.22,0:13:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于他的起源有很多猜测{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speculation about the origins…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.13,0:13:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有证据说地狱男爵…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evidence that Hellboy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.13,0:14:10.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（联邦调查局和小怪物做交易）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你说情报机关到底做了什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what is it exactly that you say this agency does?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.55,0:14:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不骗你 它捕杀怪兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kid you not. It hunts monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.23,0:14:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人声称 这个生物…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The claim, of course, that this creature…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.53,0:14:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,为联邦调查局工作 捕杀怪兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…works for the FBI as a monster hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.16,0:14:44.13,Title,0,0,0,0,,《地狱男爵》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.53,0:14:49.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（摩尔达维亚 伯尔高山口　现代）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.37,0:15:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要找的在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you seek is in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.96,0:16:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个神圣的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a sacred place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我金子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me my gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.77,0:16:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该来这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shouldn't be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.49,0:17:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.06,0:17:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.70,0:17:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对你的眼睛做了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they do to your eyes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.41,0:17:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你告诉他了吗 - 还没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you told him yet? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.34,0:17:31.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纽约 列克星敦肿瘤学中心）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.45,0:17:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该告诉他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.76,0:17:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶性肿瘤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malignant sarcoma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.03,0:17:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在肺里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln the lungs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.93,0:17:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,脊椎上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the spine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.90,0:17:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有肝里 - 我大概…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …liver. - Approximately…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.53,0:17:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还能活多久？- 也许六个星期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …how long? - Maybe six weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.44,0:18:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以替你安排住院治疗以缓解疼痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l can arrange for hospitalization and pain management.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.58,0:18:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让你在最后时光好受些 - 不用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Make the time more bearable. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.95,0:18:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更愿待在家里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'd rather be at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.78,0:18:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有一些事要安排{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l have some arrangements to make.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.92,0:18:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.42,0:18:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以随时来住院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can always get a second opinion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.63,0:18:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That won't be necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.61,0:18:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.47,0:18:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点！- 在这儿等着！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry up! - Wait right here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.91,0:18:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆·曼宁是联邦调查局特殊行动部的负责人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom Manning is the head of special operations at the FBI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.15,0:18:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他今晚来我们演播室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He joins Pat in the studio tonight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈谈最新的地狱男爵目击照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to go over the latest Hellboy sighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.05,0:18:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 这就是尾巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. That's the tail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.05,0:18:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这些是角{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these are the horns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.22,0:18:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l have a question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.35,0:18:52.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（汤姆·曼宁 联邦调查局特殊行动部负责人）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.99,0:18:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些异形 飞碟 雪人 地狱男爵的照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the pictures of aliens, UFO, the yeti, Hellboy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.76,0:18:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他们总对不准焦距？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…why is it they're always out of focus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.53,0:19:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛不告诉我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you tell us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关灵异现象研究和国家安全局的情况呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…about the Bureau of Paranormal Research and Defense?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.94,0:19:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想告诉你 我想告诉全美公众一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l wanna tell you, I wanna tell the American public one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么局来着？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this Bureau for the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.01,0:19:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵异现象研究和国家安全局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paranormal Research and Defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.72,0:19:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不存在这个机构{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no such thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.19,0:19:27.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（灵异现象研究和国家安全局 新泽西州 纽沃克）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.87,0:19:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,「废物处理部门」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}“Waste Management Services”?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.31,0:19:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.04,0:19:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·迈尔斯 联邦调查局的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Myers, FBl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.91,0:19:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,从匡提柯总局调来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transfer from Quantico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.92,0:19:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看镜头 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the birdie, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.41,0:20:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 我是约翰… - 你迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. l'm John… - You are late. That's what you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.21,0:20:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迟了五分钟 - 是的 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Five minutes. - Yes, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.45,0:20:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要去… - 51区 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- l'm going to… - Section 51. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.12,0:20:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心你的手和肘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your hands and elbows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.42,0:20:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？- 小心你的手和肘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pardon? - Watch your hands and elbows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.65,0:20:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.76,0:21:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,请替我翻一页 如果你不介意的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn the pages, please, if you don't mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.27,0:21:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,请帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.27,0:21:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻一页{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.27,0:21:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些？你在读这些？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These? You're reading these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.77,0:21:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一次读四本书 天天如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four books at once, every day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.77,0:21:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一次读四本书 天天如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four books at once, every day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.27,0:21:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一次读四本书 天天如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four books at once, every day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.77,0:21:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我能在这里替他翻书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as long as l'm there to turn the pages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.28,0:21:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫布隆姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name's Broom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.78,0:21:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫布隆姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name's Broom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.21,0:21:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,特瑞沃尔·布隆姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Trevor Broom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我是约翰…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, l'm John…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.75,0:21:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员约翰·T·迈尔斯 1976年生于堪萨斯城{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent John T Myers, Kansas City, '76.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.28,0:21:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,T代表的是赛德尔斯 母亲的兄长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}T stands for Thaddeus, mother's older brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.75,0:21:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,十岁的时候下巴有了个疤痕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scar on your chin happened when you were 10.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.12,0:21:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在指望有天它可以自动消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still wonder if it's ever going to fade away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.13,0:21:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它怎么… - 是「他」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did it… - He.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.96,0:21:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是「它」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not "it."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.40,0:21:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕·赛皮恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham Sapien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.57,0:21:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在华盛顿圣特里南弃婴医院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Discovered alive in a secret chamber…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个秘室中被发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of St. Trinian's Foundling Hospital, Washington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字是用…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name was taken from this inscription…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.61,0:21:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他生活的水柜旁边的说明文字取的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…stuck to the side of his tank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.90,0:21:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,「伊斯欧·赛皮恩」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"lcthyo Sapiens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.38,0:21:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,「1865年4月14日」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}April 14, 1865."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.21,0:22:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕·林肯死的那天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day that Abraham Lincoln died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.12,0:22:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此我们都叫他艾比·赛皮恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hence, Abe Sapien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.89,0:22:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,腐烂的蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rotten eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.56,0:22:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,很妙不是吗 艾比喜欢吃这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A delicacy. Abe loves them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.06,0:22:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎知道我这么多事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does he know so much about me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.33,0:22:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾比有个特殊的大脑额叶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abe possesses a unique frontal lobe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.93,0:22:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,「特殊」 在这里你会常听到这词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Unique." That's a word you'll hear frequently around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.67,0:22:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我到底是在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, where am l, exactly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.94,0:22:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进这房间时 该看到一句铭文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you entered the lobby, there was an inscription:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.85,0:22:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,「没有光明的地方 黑暗将大行其道」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"ln the absence of light, darkness prevails."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.15,0:22:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜里有些东西很活跃 迈尔斯探员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are things that go bump in the night, Agent Myers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.19,0:22:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不要搞错这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make no mistake about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.19,0:22:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们就是反击那些家伙的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we are the ones who bump back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.60,0:22:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,1937年 希特勒参加了北方协会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}1937, Hitler joins the Thule Society…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.07,0:22:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群沉迷于神秘学的德国贵族建立的组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a group of German aristocrats obsessed with the occult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.94,0:23:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,1938年 他得到了朗基奴斯圣矛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}1938, he acquired the Spear of Longinus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.48,0:23:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那柄刺穿了主耶稣身体的圣矛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which pierced the side of Christ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.48,0:23:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,持有圣矛的人会无敌于天下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He who holds it becomes invincible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.75,0:23:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,希特勒的权力增长了十倍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hitler's power increases tenfold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.78,0:23:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,1943年 罗斯福总统决定反击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}1943, President Roosevelt decides to fight back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.79,0:23:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵异现象研究和国家安全局就此诞生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bureau of Paranormal Research and Defense is born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.23,0:23:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,1958年 神秘学战争由于…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}1958, the Occult Wars finally come to an end…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.73,0:23:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿道夫·希特勒的死而结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with the death of Adolf Hitler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.90,0:23:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说1945年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}1945, you mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.90,0:23:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,希特勒是45年死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hitler died in '45.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.77,0:23:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he, now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.84,0:23:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈尔斯 这是克里探员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Myers, this is Agent Clay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.74,0:23:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他带你去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take his lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.41,0:23:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会向你做介绍的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll make the introductions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.45,0:23:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不来吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.92,0:23:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲手把你从70个大学毕业的新人中挑出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l handpicked you from a roster of over 70 academy graduates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.99,0:23:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make me proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.80,0:23:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not speaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.33,0:24:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,布隆姆教授把他关起来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Broom had him grounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.40,0:24:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,关起来？谁被关起来了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grounded? Who's grounded?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.91,0:24:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 你看到那鱼人了对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You saw the fish guy, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.58,0:24:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 真奇怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. That was weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.15,0:24:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.93,0:24:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 进来吧 见见其他家庭成员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, come on in. Meet the rest of the family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.20,0:24:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一天要吃六次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gets fed six times a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.80,0:24:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢猫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a thing for cats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.50,0:24:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会是他的保姆 他的保护人 他最好的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be his nanny, his keeper, his best friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.90,0:24:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人监护 他不许外出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never goes out unsupervised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.44,0:24:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.98,0:24:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨那些漫画书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l hate those comic books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.78,0:24:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是画错我的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never get the eyes right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.42,0:24:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱男爵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.76,0:25:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.93,0:25:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,按照记录他已经60岁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}60 years old by our count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.64,0:25:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他的年龄和我们的有所不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he doesn't age like we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.53,0:25:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看 狗就比我们活得短 他现在还没到二十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think reverse dog years. He's barely out of his 20s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.07,0:25:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的头发怎么样 克里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the hair, Clay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.07,0:25:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于去植发了吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally got them implants, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.51,0:25:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,会长起来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll fill in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.41,0:25:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the squirt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.44,0:25:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈尔斯探员是你的新联络员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Myers is your new liaison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.68,0:25:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't want him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.15,0:25:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 克里 你烦我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you get tired of me, Clay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.92,0:25:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那糖果 给他糖果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The candy. Give him the candy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.02,0:25:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 先生 我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sir, l…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.29,0:25:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带了这个给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l have these for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.53,0:25:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸回来了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father's back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.40,0:25:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在生气？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He still angry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.91,0:25:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你上次确实是逃跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you did break out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.60,0:25:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想见她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l wanted to see her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.27,0:25:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又不关其他人的事 - 但是 你又把自己弄上电视了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nobody's business. - lt is. You got yourself on TV again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.14,0:25:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,姓迈尔斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Myers, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.18,0:25:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有名字吗 迈尔斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a first name, Myers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.71,0:25:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要盯着看 他不喜欢人盯着他看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try not to stare. He hates it when people stare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.55,0:25:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 约翰·迈尔斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John. John Myers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.18,0:26:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 叫我约翰就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, John'll do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.29,0:26:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要盯着什么看？- 他的角 他把角挫平了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stare at what? - His horns. He files them to fit in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.00,0:26:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 你看什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you looking at, John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.47,0:26:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 没有 没什么 什么也没看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no. Nothing. Nothing at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.91,0:26:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色警报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.58,0:26:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色警报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning. Code red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.08,0:26:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正找我们呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're playing our song.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.85,0:26:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 冠军 我们去干掉一些怪兽吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, champ, let's go fight some monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.42,0:26:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们在麦肯图书馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here at the Machen Library…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.56,0:26:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,几小时前 这里的警报被触发了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where just hours ago, an alarm was triggered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.49,0:26:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约市警察对此还没有发布任何声明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The N.Y.P.D. has yet to issue a statement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.60,0:26:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这里有特种部队装甲车 还有军医{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got SWAT vans, paramedics. You name it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.20,0:26:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在又开来辆垃圾车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now here comes a garbage truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.47,0:26:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辆巨大的垃圾车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A large garbage truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.94,0:26:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这些丑陋的家伙 蓝鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at them ugly suckers, Blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.71,0:26:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和他们之间只隔一扇玻璃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One sheet of glass between them and us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.51,0:27:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一生都是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Story of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.45,0:27:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面的世界 我终于可以出去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outside. I could be outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.29,0:27:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 出去找她？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, outside with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.19,0:27:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别找我的茬 哥们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get psychic with me, fella.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.63,0:27:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没找你的茬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing psychic about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.86,0:27:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.33,0:27:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这样怎么能泡到妞？开辆垃圾车来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I gonna get a girl? I drive around in a garbage truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.27,0:27:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽兹把我们抛弃了 红大个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liz left us, Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.20,0:27:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受她的暗示吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the hint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.84,0:27:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才不接受什么暗示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't take hints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.22,0:27:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,到达目的地了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Civilians in bedroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.57,0:28:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 兄弟们 我们把跟踪器同步一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, guys, let's sync up our locators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.28,0:28:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门封上 红大个和蓝鱼就要进来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seal the doors. Red and Blue are coming in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.18,0:28:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,19点整 警报被拉响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}19 hours, an alarm was tripped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.62,0:28:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告说发现了一个大怪物 第五型的 极具攻击性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A large entity, type 5, reported. Very aggressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.22,0:28:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,六名警卫已经被杀了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six guards dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.56,0:28:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们检查过这个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l thought we checked this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.53,0:28:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是假警报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fakes and reproductions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.16,0:28:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 不是什么东西都是假的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, not everything was fake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.83,0:28:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.08,0:28:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物还在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entity is still in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.41,0:28:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,从监视器上可以看到 一座十六世纪的雕塑被破坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Video surveillance shows a 16th-century statue was destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.62,0:28:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,大法官圣狄奥尼修斯的雕塑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}St. Dionysius the Areopagite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.85,0:28:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用来驱魔的雕像 - 正是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who wards off demons. - Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.69,0:28:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过那个雕像 却是中空的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The statue, however, was hollow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.89,0:28:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个圣骨箱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A reliquary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.90,0:28:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个囚室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.43,0:29:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,梵蒂冈认为它所囚禁的怪物极其危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Vatican deemed its occupant dangerous enough…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.83,0:29:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此把它列入了亚维农名单 这名单我们也有一份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to include it on The List of Avignon, of which, by the way, we hold a copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.61,0:29:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西真棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect job for these babies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.07,0:29:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made them myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.01,0:29:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有圣水 丁香叶 银屑 白橡木 这肯定有效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy water, clove leaf, silver shavings, white oak. The works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.59,0:29:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这扇门后面 有一个黑暗的怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind this door, a dark entity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.72,0:29:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶狠 古老 而且饥饿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil, ancient and hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.66,0:29:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好啊 让我进去和它打个招呼吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well. Let me go in and say hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.86,0:30:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好查查资料 蓝鱼兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better hit the books, Brother Blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.96,0:30:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们肯定需要关于这家伙的更多信息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll definitely need more info on this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.17,0:30:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人和他一起去？天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, no one goes with him? Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.50,0:30:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他喜欢这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He likes it that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.04,0:30:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,孤胆英雄嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole "lonely hero" thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.45,0:30:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,粘鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Stinky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.79,0:30:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,厨房已经打烊了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kitchen's closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.06,0:30:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都吃了点什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you having?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.16,0:30:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,生吃了六个图书馆警卫 还有腰带和靴子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six library guards, raw, plus belts and boots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.40,0:30:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 你得多吃点素的才能消化掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you're gonna need some heavy fiber to move that out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.74,0:30:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个 我发现了些东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red, I found something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.04,0:30:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这已经绝迹的怪物叫萨莫艾尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This entity's name is Sammael, the desolate one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.98,0:30:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼尔加之子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of Nergal, brother of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.19,0:31:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 萨莫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Sammy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.26,0:31:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我枪法不怎么准 不过这枪的子弹可不小{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…l'm not a very good shot, but The Samaritan here uses really big bullets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.97,0:31:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们来个漂亮和平的方式如何{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you say we work this out in a nice, peaceful…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.25,0:31:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.86,0:31:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨莫 不听话就这种下场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it for you, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.63,0:31:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个 你应该听听其余的信息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red, you need to hear the rest of the information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.63,0:31:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 他被解决了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's taken care of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.90,0:31:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 听听这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, listen to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.34,0:31:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨莫艾尔 已绝迹的种类 黑暗的领主…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sammael, the desolate one, lord of the shadows…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.38,0:31:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼尔加之子 能够重生…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…son of Nergal, hound of resurrection… "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.31,0:32:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.25,0:32:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不喜欢这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…l don't like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.72,0:32:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喜欢什么？能够重生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Hound of resurrection?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.55,0:32:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,「瘟疫的前兆 毁灭的萌芽」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Harbinger of pestilence. Seed of destruc…"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.36,0:32:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接说关键部分吧 我怎么杀掉它？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut to the end. How do I kill it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.89,0:32:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这上面没说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.37,0:32:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,到前面去 冲啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the front. Let's go! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.20,0:32:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绕到后面去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm going around the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.53,0:32:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.39,0:32:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.80,0:32:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,都长大了啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All grown up, I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.80,0:32:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.27,0:33:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你听过的第一首催眠曲 我的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt was the first lullaby you ever heard, my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.54,0:33:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我引领你来到这个世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l ushered you into this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.24,0:33:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我知道你的真名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l alone know your true calling, your true name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.68,0:33:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛 那这个叫什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.90,0:33:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那东西 那东西 - 你认为你在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That thing. That thing. - What do you think you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.94,0:33:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认为你在干什么？- 帮你啊 我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you think you're doing? - Helping you. l…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.67,0:33:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能帮我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody helps me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.44,0:33:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的工作！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.95,0:33:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想帮忙吗 这里 帮我上子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to help? Here. Load this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.69,0:33:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是跟踪弹 把弹头弄破{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a tracking bullet. Crack the pin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.69,0:33:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你胳膊上是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, what's that on your arm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.19,0:33:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.93,0:34:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西到底是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.40,0:34:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我去问问它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.13,0:34:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 继续前进 不错 继续{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, keep coming. Good. Keep coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.13,0:34:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛 你这个小…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, you little…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.46,0:34:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.09,0:35:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正冲向平民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're heading toward civilians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.91,0:35:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很漂亮的化妆对吧？不给糖果就捣蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy costumes, huh? Trick or treat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.20,0:35:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,红灯就意味着停车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red means stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.42,0:36:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.19,0:36:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.10,0:36:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨莫 你有伤口了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, you got a leak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.08,0:36:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在等我吗 大脸怪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for me, chunk-face?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.45,0:36:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.52,0:37:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我和你都是一个头的 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- l'm on your side. - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.60,0:37:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.56,0:37:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,张开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open wide!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.06,0:37:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,娘的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.77,0:37:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.54,0:37:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝尝这个吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.29,0:38:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怕火的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm fireproof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.89,0:38:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.76,0:38:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈尔斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Myers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.50,0:38:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在 我在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Yeah? Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.37,0:38:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你胳膊怎么样了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's your arm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.20,0:38:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我胳膊没事 你在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, my arm's fine. Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.44,0:38:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚把粘鬼炸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l just fried Stinky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.57,0:38:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.51,0:38:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉老爸我会回家的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…tell Father l'll be home…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.21,0:38:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过让他别等我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but he shouldn't wait up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.81,0:38:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别别 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.38,0:38:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得和你一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I gotta go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.98,0:38:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迈尔斯 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Myers. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.62,0:38:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.66,0:38:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.66,0:39:22.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（废弃地下铁衣帽间）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.77,0:40:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨莫艾尔完成了他的使命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammael has fulfilled his destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.74,0:40:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿他安息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die in peace…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.07,0:40:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待下一次的重生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and be reborn again and again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.68,0:40:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,离月蚀还剩七天了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only seven more days till the eclipse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.12,0:40:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子会到那里去 我们也会去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The child will be there, and so will we all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.59,0:40:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.51,0:41:18.81,Note,0,0,0,0,,（贝尔拉米精神病医院 轻症监护组）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.51,0:41:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有个大个子的红人在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a big, red man down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.98,0:41:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 没事 圣诞老人还要一个月才能来呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fine, darling. Santa's not here for another month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.01,0:41:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是圣诞老人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Santa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.95,0:41:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.76,0:41:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带啤酒来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l brought beer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.90,0:41:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 红大个 你的胳膊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Red, your arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.53,0:41:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好找医生看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better get that looked at.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.98,0:41:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想见你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l wanted to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.54,0:42:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一次媒体见到他 就跑来找我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time the media gets a look at him, they run to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.64,0:42:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经没有谎话可说了 特瑞沃尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm running out of lies, Trevor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.41,0:42:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还以为你喜欢上电视呢 - 我是喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought you like being on TV. - I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.28,0:42:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过今年他已经逃跑五回了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how many escapes this year alone? Five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.01,0:42:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 他是我们的客人 不是囚犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom, he's our guest, not a prisoner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.42,0:42:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的客人可是有六英尺五英寸高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your guest is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.81,0:42:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,亮红色皮肤 长尾巴 而且由政府供养{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has a tail and is government-funded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.82,0:42:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道去哪里找他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l know where to find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.66,0:42:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会把他弄回来的 - 鱼叉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- l'll get him back. - Hey, fish stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.63,0:42:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰任何东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.96,0:42:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须碰才能看见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l need to touch it to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.33,0:42:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看见什么？- 过去 未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See what? - Past, future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.33,0:42:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何和这个东西有关的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever this object holds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.17,0:42:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是说真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls he serious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.47,0:43:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心指纹 我从来没有指纹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about fingerprints. Never had any.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.64,0:43:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授 他们来过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor, they were here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.78,0:43:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来过？尼克松？胡迪尼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was here? Nixon? Houdini?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.42,0:43:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米·胡佛？谁啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy Hoffa? Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.49,0:43:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看 艾比 让我看看这里发生的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me, Abe. Show me what happened here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.61,0:43:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是东翼检查组 一切正常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is east-wing check-in. We're all clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.91,0:43:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 记住把副馆的展品都锁起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, make sure it's all locked up over there in the annex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.22,0:43:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.14,0:44:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,克鲁南！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kroenen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.78,0:44:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.00,0:44:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.63,0:44:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.31,0:44:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从这里掩护他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll cover him from here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.18,0:44:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 不要动 放下那东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, don't move! Put that down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.98,0:44:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,把武器放下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put down the weapon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.98,0:44:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去对付他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.15,0:44:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.12,0:44:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴在地上！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.23,0:45:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后警告！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last warning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.77,0:45:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.03,0:45:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 准备欢迎它吧 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, ready the welcome, my love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.94,0:45:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,数千个天使的眼泪凝结的盐粒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salt gathered from the tears of a thousand angels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.64,0:45:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,封印了地狱犬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Restraining the essence…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.81,0:45:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨莫艾尔的灵魂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of Sammael, the hellhound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.98,0:46:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁灭的萌芽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The seed of destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.33,0:46:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我可以向你保证 萨莫艾尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This I can promise, Sammael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.94,0:46:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个你倒下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For each one of you that falls…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.21,0:46:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个新的你就会重生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…two shall arise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.08,0:46:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 教授 - 我很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Professor. - l'm all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.55,0:47:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.82,0:47:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.89,0:47:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来病得很重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are very sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.56,0:47:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望地狱男爵知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't want Hellboy to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.76,0:47:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,六十年前 他们试图毁灭世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sixty years ago, they tried to destroy the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.40,0:47:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他们又回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.47,0:47:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的残生中 他们又回来了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln my lifetime, they're back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.44,0:47:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成他们未尽的使命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to finish the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.25,0:47:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在局里很怀念你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We miss you at the bureau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.08,0:47:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾比每天都更疯狂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abe's crazier every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.52,0:47:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸还是对我发脾气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father's still mad at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.99,0:47:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来吧 丽兹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back, Liz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.96,0:47:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回来吧 - 不 不行 地狱男爵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come back. - No. No, H.B.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.86,0:47:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 现在不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.03,0:47:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不喜欢这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't like it here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.14,0:48:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我已经几个月没有幻觉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I haven't had an episode in months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.18,0:48:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.41,0:48:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始能控制它了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm learning to control it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.55,0:48:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道它的来源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm learning where it comes from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.22,0:48:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我生命中第一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time in my life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.89,0:48:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再感到害怕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…l'm not afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.17,0:48:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看来接你的车已经来了 - 让护送人员待命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Looks like your ride is here. - Have escort stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.94,0:48:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,保姆小队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Nanny Squad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.11,0:48:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 站住 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, stop. Wait. Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.28,0:48:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 能让我先进去吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, may I go first?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.22,0:48:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.08,0:48:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱男爵对他还不熟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He barely knows him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.72,0:48:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让他自己来改变这点吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he should make it his business to change that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.16,0:48:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 地狱男爵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, H.B…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.80,0:48:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里还有希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…l've got a chance out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.03,0:49:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真的关心我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you really care about me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.67,0:49:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不要再来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you won't come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.62,0:49:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.55,0:49:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…l gotta go too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.02,0:49:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有很多事要做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lots to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.73,0:49:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么你这么久才进来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What took you so long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.91,0:49:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 该回家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, time to go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.24,0:49:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮你包扎伤口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tape you up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.98,0:49:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么 多愁善感的童子军吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, a Boy Scout?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.85,0:49:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我从未当过 - 好吧 你可能骗过了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nope, I never was. - Well, you could have fooled me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.69,0:49:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.46,0:50:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你流了好多血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. You've lost a lot of blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.23,0:50:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.83,0:50:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该知道是什么能让我真正受伤 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what'll kill me, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.40,0:50:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 红大个 让我们带你回去吧 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Red, let's get you home. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.39,0:50:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被一些有机酸烧伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were burned by some organic acid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.66,0:50:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我够走运的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm lucky that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.99,0:50:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很担心你 - 担心我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I worry about you. - Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.80,0:50:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.20,0:50:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我不会永远活着 你知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…l won't be around forever, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.37,0:50:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.84,0:50:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能小心点吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you please be a little careful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.11,0:50:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 大块头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.94,0:50:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,它抓住你有多长时间？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long was it latched onto you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.78,0:50:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太清楚 大概五秒钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't know. About five seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.38,0:51:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 教授 看 - 严重吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Professor, look. - ls it bad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.69,0:51:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住你五秒钟 就下了三个蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touched you five seconds, laid three eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.89,0:51:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不给我买杯饮料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't even buy me a drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.73,0:51:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺鳌从舌头上分离 把蛋注入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stinger detaches itself from the tongue and injects the eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.14,0:51:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们对于光线和温度极其敏感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are very sensitive to heat and light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.04,0:51:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们需要潮湿黑暗的环境生长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need a humid, dark environment to breed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.58,0:51:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有没让他离开过你的视线？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever lose track of him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.29,0:51:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 让我想想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.95,0:51:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,当火车从我头上开过去的时候 我没有看住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was that moment when I had the train on top of my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.09,0:51:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能冒险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't risk it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.93,0:51:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天你和一组探员回到铁轨那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow you'll go back to the tracks with a group of agents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.40,0:51:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把整个地区彻底搜索一遍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Search the whole place top to bottom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.37,0:51:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到那些蛋 除掉它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find those eggs and destroy them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.95,0:52:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,「伊丽莎白·谢尔曼」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Elizabeth Sherman."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.08,0:52:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢「点火器」这个称呼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like the term "fire-starter."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.08,0:52:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是不喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.69,0:52:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而「火焰风暴」听起来又好像精神错乱什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And "pyrokinesis" sounds like some psychosis or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.79,0:52:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.69,0:52:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许那是对的吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.39,0:52:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能对这点释怀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not being able to let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.93,0:52:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's scary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.83,0:52:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一次幻觉后我都会昏过去 有时数小时之久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I black out after each episode. Sometimes for hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.04,0:52:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听说过很多…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear about so and so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.51,0:52:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们无法自控而歇斯底里的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who just lost control and just exploded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.21,0:52:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很走运 因为那不是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're lucky it isn't true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.74,0:52:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对我来说却是真实的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With me, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.49,0:52:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的主人在呼唤你的名字 我的女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My master is calling your name now, my girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.83,0:52:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须回到小孩的形态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must return to the child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.83,0:52:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以再一次…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So once again…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.37,0:52:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦见…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…dream…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.01,0:53:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.86,0:53:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪胎！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, freak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.56,0:53:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到这里来 怪胎！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back here, freak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.33,0:53:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们去捉弄她！- 捉弄她！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's get her! - Get her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.53,0:53:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伙计们 捉弄她！- 看这个！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get her, guys! - Watch this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.87,0:53:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪胎！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.67,0:53:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！不要再来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! Not again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.71,0:53:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！来人啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! Somebody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.21,0:53:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.81,0:53:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我！来人啊！救救我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, somebody! Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.33,0:54:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还得烧掉多少座建筑？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many buildings does she have to burn down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.40,0:54:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她属于这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She belongs here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.53,0:54:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不这么觉得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what she feels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.44,0:54:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可能永远不会回来了 这是她的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She may never feel it. It's her choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.44,0:54:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授 那女孩…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor, the girl you're…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.94,0:54:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授 你正谈及的那女孩…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor, that girl you're talking about…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.95,0:54:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,侦察员小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Boy Scout…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.95,0:54:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,童子军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Boy Scout…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.45,0:54:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,想好再说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…think twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.71,0:54:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 听着 我读了她的档案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, listen, I read her file.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.72,0:54:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「读了她的档案」 - 她在自责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Read her file." - She blames herself…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.89,0:54:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了那场美国匹兹堡的那场爆炸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for that explosion in Pittsburgh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.77,0:54:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我能帮上忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I think I can help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.92,0:55:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以去和她谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l could talk to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.43,0:55:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我能把她带回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l think I could bring her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.70,0:55:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么让你得到这个送「煎饼」的工作？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just what was it that landed you this job pushing "pamcakes, " huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.40,0:55:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.07,0:55:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的守时？还是你摆弄发型的方式？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punctuality? The way you part your hair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.27,0:55:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的专业领域是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your area of expertise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.11,0:55:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不想我和他在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't want me with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.88,0:55:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l know that much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.25,0:55:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你做得很好 - 不 我没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're doing fine. - No, l'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.65,0:55:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他尊敬的是克里 不是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, he respects Clay, not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.69,0:55:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 行了吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm really sorry, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.56,0:55:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你要的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm not your guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.89,0:55:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快死了 迈尔斯探员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm dying, Agent Myers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.16,0:55:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,像其他父亲一样 我很担心他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like any father, I worry about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.50,0:55:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在中世纪传奇故事里都会有一位年轻的骑士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln medieval stories, there is often a young knight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.40,0:55:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有多少经验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who is inexperienced…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.08,0:55:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但却有着纯真的心 - 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …but pure of heart. - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.85,0:55:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并没有什么纯真的心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I am not pure of heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.21,0:55:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.68,0:56:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉斯普亭回来找他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rasputin is back for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.59,0:56:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一要你做的就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I ask of you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.52,0:56:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我离去后在他身边勇敢地支持他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is to have the courage to stand by him when I am gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.46,0:56:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他天生就是恶魔 这无法改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was born a demon. Can't change that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.23,0:56:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你能帮助他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you will help him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.03,0:56:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,从本质上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in essence…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.53,0:56:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为一个男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to become a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.59,0:56:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个拉下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull that down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.75,0:56:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她本来复原得很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was making great progress…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.82,0:56:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在却发生了这事故{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and now this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.16,0:56:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会关门数月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be closed for months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.33,0:56:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这造成我们氯丙嗪药剂供应的短缺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it put a big dent in our Thorazine supply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.66,0:56:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,事故发生后 她就一直这个样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been like this since it happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.13,0:56:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你想进去吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you want to go in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.54,0:57:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢尔曼女士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Sherman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.65,0:57:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是联邦调查局的迈尔斯探员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm Agent Myers, FBl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.75,0:57:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢尔曼女士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Sherman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.52,0:57:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能叫你丽兹吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I call you Liz?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.36,0:57:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,美丽的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a beautiful name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.96,0:57:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界百分之六十的女性都叫丽兹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sixty percent of all the women in the world are named Liz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.47,0:57:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但我个人非常喜欢这个名字 我叫约翰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's impressive by my standards. My name's John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.80,0:57:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·T·迈尔斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John T. Myers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.91,0:57:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,布隆姆博士要我邀请你重回部门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Broom asked me to invite you back to the bureau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.54,0:57:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有特殊的预防措施 没有安全人员的护送{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No special precautions, no security escorts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.35,0:57:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像普通人 你和我坐出租车回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just you and me in a taxi like regular folks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.82,0:57:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不像是他说的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't sound like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.79,0:57:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢尔曼女士 他在请求你回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Miss Sherman, he's asking you back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.32,0:57:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你可以做出自己的选择 知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but it's entirely your choice, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.86,0:57:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choice, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.56,0:57:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那中听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.53,0:57:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经离开过这部门十三次了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l've quit the bureau 13 times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.03,0:57:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每次又总是回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l always go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.44,0:57:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有其它什么地方可去的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where else would I go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.42,0:58:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,「废弃的地铁空地」在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.39,0:58:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过那些蛋需要黑暗潮湿的环境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said those eggs need it dark and humid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.06,0:58:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们这回可中大奖了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they hit the jackpot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.16,0:58:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地铁线 它们全集中在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The subway lines, they all converge right around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.70,0:58:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们正下方 有座古老的凡迪维尔水库{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right below us is the old Vandeveer reservoir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.27,0:58:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,水库在30年代中期就被废弃了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt was abandoned in the mid-30s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.27,0:58:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有脉冲信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a pulse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.18,0:58:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里 在另一边有个蓄水池{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. A cistern on the other side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.45,0:58:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数蛋都在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of the eggs are there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.69,0:58:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有路进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.52,0:58:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该回去申请特别的二号类型许可{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go back and request a special permit, type 2…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.61,0:59:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来还是不来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys coming or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.57,0:59:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会带你过一种无害的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lead a charmed life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.32,0:59:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you are, doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.75,0:59:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个应能保护你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This should cover your tail fin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.75,0:59:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马教廷的圣骨匣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reliquary. Straight from the Vatican.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.26,1:00:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣徒狄奥尼修斯的骨头 看起来像小手指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bone from St. Dionysius. Looks like a pinkie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.76,1:00:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我为什么是我去做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind me why I keep doing this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.70,1:00:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,腐臭的蛋和全人类的安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rotten eggs and the safety of mankind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.95,1:00:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去并不像洋娃娃的头发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This doesn't really look like doll's hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.78,1:00:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 红大个 你认为呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be honest, Red. What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.75,1:01:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想我来帮你梳理得了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm thinking about doing it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.89,1:01:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有什么发现？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you guys find anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.66,1:01:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没发现蛋 红大个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No eggs yet, Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.82,1:01:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你在午餐休息吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you on a lunch break?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.79,1:01:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.00,1:01:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个正在行动 我会掩护他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red's on the move. l'll cover him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.15,1:01:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 红大个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.69,1:03:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是艾比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's Abe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.33,1:03:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.30,1:03:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的武器拿过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring your toy over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.63,1:03:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.40,1:03:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.37,1:03:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个 我会很快煎熟它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one. l'll fry him quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.71,1:03:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个 有两个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two. There were two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.97,1:04:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.74,1:04:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个 回话 红大个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red. Come in, Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.21,1:04:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里？我接受不到信号 你到底在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your 20? I got no signal. Where the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.58,1:04:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的地形像瑞士硬干酪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like Swiss cheese in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.58,1:04:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 悠着点 我在追他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit tight, pal, l'm on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.30,1:04:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨莫艾尔 可以重生的地狱之犬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammael, hound of the resurrection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.88,1:04:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是已杀了你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't I kill you already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.36,1:04:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这讨厌的怪物！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You goddamn monster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.28,1:05:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.76,1:05:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的电话！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.23,1:05:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该伤害人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't hurt people!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.96,1:06:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没打中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You missed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.91,1:06:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,大脸怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, chunk-face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.85,1:06:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你这样的大怪物 应该攻击得更好才是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do better than that, big monster like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.27,1:07:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,请救救我的小猫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My kittens! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.87,1:07:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,来人啊 请救救我的小猫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody, please, get my kittens!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.65,1:07:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,才第二次约会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.98,1:07:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要用舌头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.13,1:07:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心我的小猫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My kittens. Careful with them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.73,1:07:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 不要烦我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady, give me a break!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.25,1:08:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.92,1:08:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.48,1:09:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里 我接受到艾比的信号 我正赶回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clay, I'm getting a signal from Abe. I'm on my way back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.98,1:09:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 不要再上前了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, don't take another step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.81,1:09:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.68,1:10:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人员伤亡 需要一辆救护车 立刻派来 收到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man down. I need an ambulance right away. Do you read me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.92,1:10:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 坚持住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang in there, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.95,1:10:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人员伤亡 收到了吗 收到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man down. Do you read? Do you read?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.83,1:10:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,科瑞尔 莫斯 收到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quarry, Moss, do you read me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.66,1:10:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,科瑞尔 莫斯 收到了吗 有人员伤亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quarry, Moss, do you read me? Man down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.54,1:10:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面的感觉真好 好久都没这样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels good to be outside. It's been so long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.74,1:10:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样不安全 谢尔曼女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that's… That's not safe Miss Sherman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.48,1:10:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,请待在车里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please stay in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.58,1:10:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢尔曼女士 请不要这样 你能坐下来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Miss Sherman. Please, can you come down, Miss Sherman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.26,1:11:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,风景真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.80,1:11:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑一笑 那就对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, a smile, huh? Yeah, that's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.27,1:11:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.44,1:11:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.04,1:11:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等会你得再给我照一张 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'll have to take another one later. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.94,1:11:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会好起来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.01,1:11:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是每个人都这么幸运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everyone was so lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.74,1:11:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位探员殉职了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had two agents die today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.78,1:12:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里也许活不过今晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clay probably won't survive the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.38,1:12:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 曼宁 现在请别提这些 - 我想你的问题是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not now, Manning, please. - My problem with you:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.82,1:12:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做事不顾后果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're reckless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.46,1:12:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人信任你 让你做团队的头儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These men trusted you to lead them as a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.96,1:12:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.70,1:12:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比你更了解这些人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l knew those men better than you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.73,1:12:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么 你就安心了 - 不 这并不使我安心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That makes it all right, then. - No, it doesn't make it all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.44,1:12:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我至少制服了那玩意儿 是吧？- 是的 你制服了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I stopped that thing, didn't l? - Yes, you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.17,1:12:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的工作 这就是为什么我们需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what you do. It's why we need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.47,1:12:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一种洞察力 你了解这些怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have an insight. You know monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.68,1:12:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you trying to say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.68,1:12:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这整件事是一场闹剧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole thing is a farce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.68,1:12:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为到最后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because in the end…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.19,1:12:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,…在你杀光 捉光了所有的怪物后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…after you've killed, after you've captured every freak out there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.46,1:12:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,…还是有个剩下的怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there's still one left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.13,1:12:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.07,1:12:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼宁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Manning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.97,1:12:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我能更友好一些 但…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l wish I could be more gracious, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.94,1:13:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.98,1:13:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,布隆姆教授 我只在这里待一个周末{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only for the weekend, Professor Broom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.52,1:13:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就该走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I shall be on my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.15,1:13:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该四处看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you should have a look around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.29,1:13:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里变化不小{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made some changes around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.00,1:13:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把这个东西关起来 马上就关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l want that thing locked up, starting now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.94,1:13:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就关！你听到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now! Do you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.07,1:13:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就关 你听到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.14,1:13:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把他关起来！- 他一点也没改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Locked up! - Nothing's changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.28,1:13:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,家 甜蜜的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home sweet home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.71,1:13:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽兹？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liz?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.51,1:13:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽兹！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liz!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.22,1:13:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把她带来了 兄弟 你把她带来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it, buddy. You did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.49,1:13:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈尔斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Myers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.83,1:13:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.44,1:14:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.04,1:14:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手腕上是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's that on your wrist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.14,1:14:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.91,1:14:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我从心理治疗中学来的 - 嗯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's something I learned in therapy. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.32,1:14:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感到沮丧 就拉一次橡皮圈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm depressed, one rubber band.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.49,1:14:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,感到焦虑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm impatient…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.52,1:14:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉两次橡皮圈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…two rubber bands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.52,1:14:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.60,1:14:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该捆紧你的一个橡皮圈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should get you a fresh pack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.27,1:14:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 也许两个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.54,1:14:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 也许吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.61,1:14:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把这些食物放在这里 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm gonna put these over here, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.15,1:14:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 等一等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One minute. One minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.89,1:14:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 迈尔斯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Myers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.62,1:14:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你是一个善于言辞的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you're a talker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.99,1:14:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就表达「需要」来说 有没有更好的词语？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a good word, a solid word, for "need"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.39,1:15:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.73,1:15:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,…「需要」本身就是很好的词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…"need" is a good, solid word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.90,1:15:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,太直白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too needy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.30,1:15:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吃吧？还有墨西哥烤玉米片要送来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start in, okay? You got nachos coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.60,1:15:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨西哥烤玉米片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nachos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.90,1:15:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.67,1:15:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这整堆垃圾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.24,1:15:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁养了小孩吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who had babies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.01,1:15:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽兹 有些事你得听我说说 这…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liz, there's something I need for you to hear, and it's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.15,1:15:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间长吗？因为我马上要出去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will it take long? Because l'm actually going out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.42,1:15:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.96,1:15:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是「离开」 还是去散心？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Out" out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.49,1:15:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去喝杯咖啡 但你继续 读吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, for a cup of coffee, but go ahead, read.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.66,1:15:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.67,1:15:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 迈尔斯带我出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Myers is taking me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.00,1:15:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的红辣椒酱快冷了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, your chili's getting cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.01,1:15:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不饿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.11,1:15:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是要跟我说些事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls there something you'd like me to hear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.34,1:15:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是一个列表 但还未完成 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's just a list. It's not finished. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.21,1:15:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那么 迟点再说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.92,1:15:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.95,1:16:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还需要什么？- 不用你管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything else you need? - Not from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.22,1:16:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.43,1:16:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.40,1:16:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,研究对象 卡尔·卢布里切特·克鲁南{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject: Karl Ruprecht Kroenen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.91,1:16:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,1897年生于德国慕尼黑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Born in Munich, 1897.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.88,1:16:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,患上一种叫「外科手术嗜爱狂」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suffered from a masochistic compulsion…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.65,1:16:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,…的虐待狂强迫症{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…commonly known as surgical addiction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.39,1:16:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼皮都被移除了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both eyelids surgically removed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.06,1:16:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,…上嘴唇…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…along with his upper…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.33,1:16:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…和下嘴唇也一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and lower lip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.73,1:16:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,血管中的血液早已干涸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blood in his veins dried up decades ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.51,1:16:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩尘土{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only dust remains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.08,1:17:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的恐怖意志…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What horrible will…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.95,1:17:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,…能使这样的生物还活着？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…could keep such a creature as this alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.05,1:17:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.86,1:17:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 红大个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.93,1:17:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.77,1:17:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 红大个 别再逃了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Red. Not again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.71,1:18:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,来份那种甜饼 你这儿有油炸圈饼吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one of those cookies. Do you have any doughnuts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.44,1:18:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 朋友 来个「熊爪」怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, pal. How about a bear claw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.53,1:18:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想要些什么吗？店快打烊了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want anything else? The shop's closing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.80,1:18:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.84,1:18:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen about…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.94,1:18:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我钦佩他 他是自然之力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l admire him. He's a force of nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.71,1:18:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩出来要谈些什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you two talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.48,1:18:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事会如此的迷人和重要？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is so fascinating, so important?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.95,1:18:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他太顽固而且不听劝告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He's determined, unstoppable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.48,1:18:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人会把那看作自以为是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people would call that cocky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.65,1:18:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他只是太好强了 - 是啊 他就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's just strong. - Yeah. That he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.32,1:18:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿了你的那份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, l've got yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.56,1:18:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叔叔 他以前常说 我们喜欢人是因为他们的优点…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My uncle, he used to say we like people for their qualities…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.33,1:18:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,…但爱上人却是因为他们的缺点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but love them for their defects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.57,1:19:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爱你 你知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loves you, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.60,1:19:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.67,1:19:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说不清 我和他是青梅竹马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't know. I grew up with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.24,1:19:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在每当我一看到他 我就感到困扰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now every time I see him, I get confused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.38,1:19:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎每天他都在我的脑海里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's hardly a day that goes by that he's not in my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.52,1:19:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至现在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.82,1:19:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我都感觉好像他在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…l feel like he's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.36,1:19:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.99,1:19:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱吃油炸圈饼吗 我有两个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like doughnuts? I got two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.23,1:19:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 很好吃 - 我还有个甜饼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. That was nice. - I got a cookie, as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.20,1:19:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要糖吗？- 谢谢你 不要糖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sugar? - No. No sugar. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.60,1:19:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋 不要给她奶油和糖 她喜欢喝黑咖啡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No cream and sugar, moron. She takes it black.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.54,1:19:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我这里有些牛奶 - 不用 我不喝牛奶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got some milk here. - No. l'm okay. I don't take milk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.24,1:19:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说对了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.31,1:19:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为他照相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took his picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.28,1:19:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.62,1:19:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为他照相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took his picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.82,1:19:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为他照相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took his picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.36,1:20:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为他照相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took his picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.17,1:20:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.01,1:20:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真冷啊 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's freezing, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.18,1:20:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝咖啡使我感到暖和{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee's warming me up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.32,1:20:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那现在我们去干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do we do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.25,1:20:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,新泽西州的纽沃克 娱乐首府{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newark, New Jersey, entertainment capital of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.36,1:20:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你听上去像个游戏节目的主持人 - 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sound like a game-show host. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.40,1:20:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是地狱男爵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Hellboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.20,1:20:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在执行任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm on a mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.15,1:20:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说你的一些事 你从哪里来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, tell me something about you. Where do you come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.65,1:20:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前大部分时间和我叔叔一起生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l lived with my uncle most of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.19,1:20:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来我去了弗吉尼亚州的匡提柯 当上了我班上的头名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I went to Quantico, went to top of my class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.98,1:20:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点也不像…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm nothing like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.19,1:20:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要告诉别人见过我好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell anyone, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.17,1:21:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attaboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.67,1:21:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 他没有带上定位器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, he left his locator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.04,1:21:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们该派人去找他吗 - 够了 受够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shall we send out some scouts? - Enough, enough, enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.02,1:21:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他永远也长不大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll never change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.75,1:21:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.46,1:21:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远都是小孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.51,1:21:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安公墓 第十六号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian Plackba, number 16.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.08,1:21:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在莫斯科{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moscow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.98,1:21:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么人想对付我们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants us in Moscow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.03,1:22:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我老妈烤的饼干 - 她在笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My mom baked them. - She's laughing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.60,1:22:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她坐在公园的长椅子上 而且她在大笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's sitting on a park bench, and she's laughing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.87,1:22:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样了 我完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. l'm done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.81,1:22:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看上去不像是间谍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't look like spies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.57,1:22:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.88,1:22:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看那个家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.71,1:22:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那阴险的小眼 那咧嘴的假笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those shady little eyes, that phony grin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.95,1:23:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会吃那个吗 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you going to eat that? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.05,1:23:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在打哈欠 他感到无聊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, he's yawning. He's bored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.36,1:23:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,老土的打哈欠花招{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the old yawning trick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.03,1:23:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着他的手臂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch his arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.34,1:23:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先他想要我的工作 接着他想要我的女友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First he wants my job, then he wants my girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.51,1:23:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们每人都有自己尽力隐藏的另一面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we all have a side that we try to hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.25,1:23:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.12,1:23:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.89,1:23:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁扔的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, who threw that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.03,1:23:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？- 还好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - Yeah, l'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.14,1:23:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔得真准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.41,1:24:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安公墓 第十六号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian Plackba, number 16.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.15,1:24:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是拉斯普亭的陵墓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Rasputin's mausoleum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.09,1:24:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见了木偶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l see the puppet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.59,1:24:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那操纵木偶的人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But where is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.83,1:24:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,…在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the puppeteer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.53,1:24:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 布隆姆教授{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good, Professor Broom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.30,1:24:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt was you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.94,1:24:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那纸的碎片…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scraps of paper…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.57,1:24:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,…丽兹突然爆发和回归{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Liz's sudden relapse and return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.54,1:24:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像在寓言中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bread crumbs on the trail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.61,1:24:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,用面包屑来标记道路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like in a fable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.81,1:24:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些事转移了他的注意力…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They both distract him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.62,1:24:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,…并指引他到我要他去的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and guide him exactly where I need him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.92,1:24:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫斯科{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moscow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.25,1:24:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的宿命之地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.69,1:24:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,而最后的一个线索…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the last clue…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.16,1:24:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,…将是已故的布隆姆教授{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…will be left by the late Professor Broom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.46,1:24:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你养大了这孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You raised the child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.33,1:24:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,教育了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nurtured him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.37,1:24:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以作为回报…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So in return…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.90,1:24:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我允许你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…l will permit you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.67,1:25:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,…看一眼未来的情形{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a brief, brief glimpse of the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.84,1:25:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将打开地狱之门…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will open the portal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.17,1:25:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,…带来世界的末日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and bring about the end of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.35,1:25:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果六十年前你杀掉他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only you had had him destroyed 60 years ago…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.02,1:25:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,…那这一切就不会发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…none of this would have come to pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.35,1:25:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你又怎么可能知道呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, how could you have known?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.89,1:25:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的上帝选择了沉默{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your God chooses to remain silent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.69,1:25:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我的却与我同在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine lives within me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.16,1:25:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次当我死掉并重生后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I died and crossed over…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.70,1:26:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,…就会带回…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a little more of the master…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.17,1:26:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,…主人的一小部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…came back with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.14,1:26:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他向我展示了孩子的真名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He disclosed to me the child's true name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.38,1:26:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to know it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.38,1:26:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l know what to call him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.02,1:26:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你说或者做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing you can do or say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.95,1:26:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,都无法改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…can change that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.09,1:26:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l call him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.36,1:26:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,…儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.20,1:26:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.14,1:26:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,会很快的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.83,1:27:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接过去告诉她你的感受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go there and tell her how you feel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.40,1:27:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老妈常说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom says that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.74,1:27:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 这没有那么简单 明白吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's not… It's not that easy, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.41,1:27:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 你才九岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, you're 9.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.05,1:27:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没有老到可以给我建议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not old enough to be giving me advice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.62,1:27:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 停下来 - 那些人是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, stand by. - Who are those guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.16,1:27:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽兹 对不起 是布隆姆出事了 我们走吧 我们得找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liz, l'm sorry. It's Broom. Let's go. We need to find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.03,1:27:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不！- 等等 发生了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Wait, what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.07,1:27:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会的！- 没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.57,1:27:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不会是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.10,1:27:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能带她回去吗 - 不对劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you take her? - Something's wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.98,1:29:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经三天没和任何人说过话了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hasn't spoken to anybody in three days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.55,1:29:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一句也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.52,1:29:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他既不吃也不睡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't eat, he won't sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.62,1:29:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过他这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l've never seen him like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.86,1:29:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.53,1:29:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该留下吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I stay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.03,1:29:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下来陪他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With him, I mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.97,1:30:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我并不是一个问题解决专家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, l'm not much of a problem solver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.44,1:30:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十年来 我只完成了魔方的两面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three decades, l've only completed two sides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.18,1:30:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道这一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do know this much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.78,1:30:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有麻烦的话…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lf there's trouble…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.18,1:30:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我们这些怪胎只能相互信任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all us freaks have is each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.39,1:30:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被困在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And l'm stuck here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.12,1:30:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.92,1:30:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以为我照顾好那大猴子吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…take care of the big monkey for me, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.66,1:30:39.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莫斯科 陀波科巴军事基地）
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.77,1:31:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收藏了很多有趣的事物…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l have accumulated many objects of great interest…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.94,1:31:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,以保存我们的文化传统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…preserving our heritage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.25,1:31:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人 和我一样 都相信祖国母亲…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many, like me, believe Mother Russia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.52,1:31:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将迎来一个历史性的重生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to be very close to a historic rebirth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.12,1:31:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,重生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Rebirth"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.82,1:31:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢那词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.17,1:31:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十吨重的岩石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty tons of stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.07,1:31:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是坠落到通古斯森林中的那块陨石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing fell from the sky into Tunguska Forest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.17,1:31:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,1908年6月30日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}June 30th, 1908.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.34,1:31:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时的罗曼诺夫王朝立刻占有了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Romanovs took possession of it immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.68,1:31:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就想得到它了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l've wanted it for ages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.95,1:31:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该知道…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're aware, of course…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.48,1:31:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法把它带出俄罗斯领土{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there's no way you'll get it out of Russian territory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.38,1:31:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道的 我们的客人会来俄罗斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is aware. Our guests are coming in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.16,1:32:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,维罗克拉斯基郊外 距离莫斯科50英里 那是我们的目的地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Volokolamsk Fields, 50 miles from Moscow, that's where we're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.36,1:32:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安公墓 第十六号 这是我们唯一的线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian Plackba, number 16. That's the only clue we have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.90,1:32:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经收集并毁灭了数以千计的蛋…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've collected and destroyed thousands of eggs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.77,1:32:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们仍没有萨莫艾尔或拉斯普亭的踪迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but we have no trace of this Sammael or this Rasputin character.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.91,1:32:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一得到许可和装备就行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We leave as soon as we get clearance and equipment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.61,1:32:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱男爵会一起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellboy's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.78,1:32:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对此感到不愉快 但这次我是负责人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm not pleased about that, but l'll be in charge this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.98,1:32:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这次得隐秘行动 不然这怪物就别想再出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We either wrap this up or l'm closing this freak show for good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.24,1:32:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'll…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.21,1:32:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,…去莫斯科…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…come to Moscow…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.17,1:32:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,…如果你还去的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if you're still going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.98,1:32:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.64,1:32:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有些话想说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have something to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.52,1:33:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解你不喜欢我的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l understand what you don't like about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.09,1:33:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.69,1:33:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是恶魔…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I am…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.76,1:33:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,…这使你感到有些不适…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…makes you feel a little out of place…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.79,1:33:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,…想离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.96,1:33:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 红大个 我没有… - 听好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Red, I don't… - Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.07,1:33:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不像迈尔斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm not like Myers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.74,1:33:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他才是你的归属{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He makes you feel like you belong…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.87,1:33:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,…那真的很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which is good, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.38,1:33:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望可以改变自己的容貌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l wish I could do something about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.99,1:33:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我无法做到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.99,1:33:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证两件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l can promise you two things:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.49,1:33:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 我会永远是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, l'll always look this good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.87,1:33:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And two…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.50,1:33:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决不放弃爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…l'll never give up on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.21,1:33:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,决不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.48,1:34:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.38,1:34:11.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（俄罗斯领空）
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.59,1:34:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这上面刻的是萨莫艾尔 铭文写道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This engraving here represents Sammy. Text reads:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.36,1:34:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,死一个会有两个重生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"One falls, two shall arise. Sammael."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.77,1:34:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须得同时把它们和蛋干掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to nail them all at once, and the eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.57,1:34:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动时不要恣意妄为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when we do, no mumbo jumbo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.98,1:34:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,双核Vulcan65型手雷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double-core Vulcan-65 grenades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.98,1:34:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面已装好定时器 设置好就离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've installed a handy little timer. You set it, you walk away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.52,1:34:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,线会拉开安全别针{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cable pulls the safety pins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.75,1:34:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,轰隆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kaboom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.92,1:34:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,容易清理容易使用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy to clean, easy to use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.92,1:34:49.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莫斯科 维罗克拉斯基郊外）
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.80,1:34:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,火花对红大个讲话 听到吗请回话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sparky to Big Red. Do you read me? Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.87,1:34:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,火花？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sparky"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.34,1:35:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想出来的？迈尔斯吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who came up with that? Myers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.94,1:35:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们现在要离开主车道 抓紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're leaving the main road, so hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.14,1:35:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这最好就是那地方 我快要晕车呕吐了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This better be the place or l'll puke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.45,1:35:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好出来看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better come out and see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.70,1:35:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安公墓 第十六号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian Plackba, number 16.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.85,1:35:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 我们永远无法找到那陵墓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it. We're never gonna find Rasputin's mausoleum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.18,1:35:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直就是一座城{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's practically a city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.79,1:35:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,又臭又脏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it stinks, and it's muddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.26,1:35:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议先回去找个旅馆 整顿好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l think we go back, we check into the hotel, we regroup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.43,1:35:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃完早饭后再来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After breakfast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.43,1:36:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要做的就是建立起一个方格图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l think what we have to do here is we have to make a grid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.07,1:36:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们按图的象限进行搜寻 也许用卫星照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go in by quadrants. Maybe satellite photography.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.51,1:36:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来问路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask for directions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.78,1:36:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.16,1:36:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 宝贝 帮我找一个会说话的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby, find me a talker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.18,1:36:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.97,1:37:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.37,1:37:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.37,1:37:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.21,1:37:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.81,1:37:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太荒谬了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is ridiculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.75,1:37:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,主管是我 不是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l run this show, not him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.45,1:37:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙只会惹麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy's nothing but trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.49,1:37:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过去十分钟了 我们走吧 - 你能不能闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ten minutes, we're out of here. - Will you shut up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.13,1:37:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让他这样去做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and let him do his thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.26,1:37:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人还有能量棒吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody got a PowerBar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.03,1:37:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.40,1:37:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再走六十英尺 同志们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sixty feet further, comrades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.74,1:37:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着进入第三排{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And three rows in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.08,1:37:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他背上的是什么鬼东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that on his back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.98,1:37:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是伊凡·克里门托维奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This here is lvan Klimentovich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.92,1:37:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,说「你好」 伊凡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say "hi, " lvan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.85,1:38:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,走那条路 红猴子！{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.49,1:38:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.93,1:38:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡说下面是一个错综复杂的通道网络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lvan says there's a whole network of tunnels down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.94,1:38:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,绵延数英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goes on for miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.34,1:38:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家靠紧些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay close, everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.45,1:38:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好找对了地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better be right about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.86,1:38:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们不分散就没有问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be all right as long as we don't separate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.41,1:39:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,火花{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sparky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.58,1:39:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉每个人打开他的定位腰带 如果有人看到了什么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell everyone to turn their locator belts on. Anybody sees anything…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.38,1:39:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会说「马可」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'll say "Marco."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.75,1:39:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,波罗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Polo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.22,1:39:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确信要这么做？- 以一到十的刻度：二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you sure about this? - On a scale of one to ten: two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.12,1:39:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 侦察员小子 她会照顾你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Boy Scout, she'll take care of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.46,1:39:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很强的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a tough one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.80,1:39:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.74,1:39:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,问问你的好友这条路还有多远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask your buddy how far this thing goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.40,1:39:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我背上怎么样 伊凡？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing up there, lvan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.70,1:39:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我有腿 我会踢你的屁股{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.80,1:40:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我抱一会儿吗 他太消极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you mind holding this guy for a while? He is so negative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.12,1:40:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那究竟是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.93,1:40:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很大的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something big.{\r}
