Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.68,1:40:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.64,1:40:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me!{\r}
