Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.29,1:40:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你！我不怕你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you! I am not afraid of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.83,1:41:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了算！我们回去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm in charge! We go back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.80,1:41:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是死了的好！{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.07,1:41:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.{\r}
