Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.39,1:43:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你笑什么 你这狗娘养的纳粹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you laughing at, you Nazi son of a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.79,1:44:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,想都别想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.75,1:44:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都给你 针头脑袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all for you, pinhead.{\r}
