Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.14,1:45:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 你对我的那种感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that, you know, you feel that way about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.74,1:45:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在想知道这个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know that here? Now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.68,1:45:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.89,1:45:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个 白大个 不管怎样 男人们都一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red, white, whatever. Guys are all the same.{\r}
