Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.95,1:46:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢退回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's back out real slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.45,1:46:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢退回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's back out real slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.34,1:46:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈尔斯 准备好手雷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Myers, ready your grenades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.27,1:46:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,马可 马可 马可{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marco. Marco. Marco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.11,1:46:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快挪动你的大红屁股赶过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your big, red butt over here.{\r}
