Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.22,1:49:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.26,1:49:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像所许诺的一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the way it was promised.{\r}
