Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.05,1:50:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,…看见了一位天使{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and beheld an angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.05,1:50:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他的右手中 握着打开无底深渊的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in his right hand, the key to the bottomless pit."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.55,1:50:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他的右手中 握着打开无底深渊的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in his right hand, the key to the bottomless pit."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.56,1:50:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在多博尔斯克的乡下时就听过这句话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These were the words I heard as a peasant boy in Tobolsk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.56,1:51:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在 这扇门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.36,1:51:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过奥格都·杰哈德送来的门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sent by the Ogdru Jahad…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.20,1:51:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们终于可以来到这世界了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so that they might at long last enter our world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.64,1:51:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是那钥匙 就是你那毁灭一切的右手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the key, the right hand of doom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.61,1:51:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那只石手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your stone hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.45,1:51:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为那是用来做什么的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you think it was made for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.82,1:51:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开锁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the locks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.39,1:51:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要打开 红大个！不要打开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do it, Red! Don't do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.86,1:51:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.83,1:51:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lmagine it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.53,1:51:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个伊甸园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An Eden…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.80,1:51:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你和她而设{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for you and her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.53,1:51:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.60,1:51:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.11,1:51:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就用她的灵魂来交换吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln exchange for her soul, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.58,1:51:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开那扇门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.42,1:51:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.82,1:51:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如你所愿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.66,1:52:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.78,1:52:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽兹！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liz!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.86,1:52:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的灵魂去了另一个世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her soul awaits on the other side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.19,1:52:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想让她回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lf you want her back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.33,1:52:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…open the door and claim her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.10,1:52:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的真名就刻在这些枷锁上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your true name is inscribed around the locks that hold you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.91,1:52:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法打破它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot break them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.57,1:52:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你有多么的强壮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…no matter how strong you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.28,1:52:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,月蚀开始了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The eclipse has begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.52,1:53:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的真名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your true name…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.45,1:53:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,念出来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…say it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.09,1:53:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Become the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.27,1:53:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.67,1:53:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿努·恩·拉玛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anung un Rama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.78,1:53:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,再念一遍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.58,1:53:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿努·恩·拉玛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anung un Rama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.53,1:55:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开最后的锁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the final lock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.50,1:56:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,回想起真正的你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember who you are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.52,1:56:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我活了足够长的岁月来知晓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I have lived long enough to know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.86,1:56:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,为这世界 一滴眼泪也不值得流下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…not a tear will be shed for this world!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.46,1:56:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.16,1:56:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲留给你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father gave you that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.86,1:56:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你没有选择！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.36,1:56:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开它！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.37,1:56:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快打开它！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.13,1:57:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.00,1:57:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做出了选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l chose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.75,1:57:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远无法完成你的宿命了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never fulfill your destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.55,1:57:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远不会了解你的真正力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never understand the power inside you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.69,1:57:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到方法像这样活下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'll just have to find a way to live with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.17,1:57:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.80,1:57:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你都干了些什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what you've done.{\r}
