Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.01,1:57:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个无足轻重的小人物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…an insignificant man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.04,1:57:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你却带来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have brought forth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.15,1:57:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.39,1:58:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈尔斯 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Myers, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.18,1:58:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱对我们来说没有什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell will hold no surprises for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.83,1:58:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿了手雷腰环{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l took a grenade belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:47.60,1:58:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这该死的东西坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The damn thing's broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.60,1:58:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护她 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep her safe, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:56.94,1:58:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管发生了什么 不要离开她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happens, don't leave her alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:00.08,1:59:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会离开她的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.19,1:59:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很好 迈尔斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay, Myers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.89,1:59:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.99,1:59:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.16,1:59:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉开导线就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just pull the cable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.76,1:59:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没怪过你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l didn't get you anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.10,1:59:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你独自一人能应付吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to be okay alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.34,1:59:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能有多厉害？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How big can it be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.78,1:59:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.53,1:59:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.95,2:00:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会很痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is gonna hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:20.32,2:01:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早醒来时都会觉得疼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna be sore in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.27,2:01:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没有脉搏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got no pulse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.14,2:01:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有呼吸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not breathing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.75,2:01:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽兹？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liz?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.49,2:02:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真笨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l was so foolish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.82,2:02:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.40,2:02:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在黑暗中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln the dark…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.64,2:02:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到你的声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…l heard your voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.54,2:02:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.41,2:02:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}l said, "Hey…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.88,2:03:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那个世界中的你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you on the other side…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.95,2:03:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她自由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…let her go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.46,2:03:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because for…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.93,2:03:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了她我会过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For her l'll cross over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.67,2:03:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时你就会后悔了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you'll be sorry."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.83,2:03:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么使一个人成为真正的男人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes a man a man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.73,2:03:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我的一个朋友曾经思考过这个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend of mine once wondered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.03,2:03:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个人的出身 还是他的生存方式？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it his origins? The way he comes to life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.57,2:03:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为都不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.57,2:04:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为是他所做出的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the choices he makes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.68,2:04:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他选择怎样去开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not how he starts things…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.15,2:04:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是他选择怎样去结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but how he decides to end them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.18,2:06:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家去哪儿了？我还在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys? l'm still here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.42,2:06:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
